flowchart LR
  FD[input FD] --> P[bounded text parser / explicit codec]
  P -->|record_sink_fn + ctx| Q[bounded ring by value]
  Q --> W[one worker]
  W --> S[checked stats]
  S --> O[final status]
  SIG[SIGINT/SIGTERM] --> F[sig_atomic_t stop flag]
  F --> M[main normal-context shutdown]
  M --> Q
